              <th class="text-left p-3 text-theme-primary font-semibold">Why It's Hard to Cut Further</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="text-theme-secondary">
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 font-medium">Wire rod (steel)</td>
              <td class="p-3">55–65%</td>
              <td class="p-3">Commodity-priced; identical for every factory</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
